OL,3,GNEWSAWater supplies at risk due to
OL,4,Aleaks, firm warned
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water's repeated failure to
OL,7,Ftackle leaks is putting supplies at
OL,8,Frisk, regulators have warned.
OL,10,FOfwat, the Department of the
OL,11,FEnvironment, Food and Rural Affairs and
OL,12,Fthe Environment Agency wrote to the
OL,13,Ffirm to warn leakage levels were 18.5%
OL,14,Fabove forecast and had increased since
OL,15,Fthe previous year.
OL,17,FThe joint letter, seen by the BBC, said
OL,18,Fthe leakage rate was "unacceptable" and
OL,19,Fplaced customers "at a greater level of
OL,20,Frisk" given ongoing drought conditions.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
