OL,3,GNEWSAWater supplies at risk due to
OL,4,Aleaks, firm warned
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said it was investing
OL,7,F"significant resource" into finding and
OL,8,Ffixing leaks across the network and had
OL,9,Frepaired "more than 23,000 leaks" over
OL,10,Fthe last 12 months.
